<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:105%"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri">Dear&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">[Insert Name]</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">,</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:105%"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:105%"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri">Community groups,
clubs and schools can help save lives by hosting blood drive with the American
Red Cross. For patients who need donated blood to survive, this commitment to
step up gives them a chance at more time with those who love them. Through our
Club Program, the Red Cross can offer an even more rewarding hosting experience
for you and your organization.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:105%"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:105%"><b><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri">Here’s how the
Community Club Program works:<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:105%"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<ol style="margin-top:0in" start="1" type="1">
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:
     0in;mso-margin-bottom-alt:8.0pt;mso-margin-top-alt:0in;mso-add-space:auto;
     line-height:105%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:
     Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;
     mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri">Host a blood drive and collect 30 or more
     pints of blood.*<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:
     0in;mso-margin-bottom-alt:8.0pt;mso-margin-top-alt:0in;mso-add-space:auto;
     line-height:105%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:
     Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;
     mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri">Your club will be credited $10 for each pint
     collected at your blood drive! </span></b><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:
     Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;
     mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri"><o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:
     0in;mso-margin-bottom-alt:8.0pt;mso-margin-top-alt:0in;mso-add-space:auto;
     line-height:105%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:
     Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;
     mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri">Funds are forwarded directly to the
     third-party vendor of your choice** to purchase supplies, equipment or any
     item(s) that benefit your organization.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ol>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:105%"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;
mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:
Calibri">If your club needs new uniforms, supplies, equipment, etc., for
example, your American Red Cross blood drive can help you fund them! <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;
mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:
Calibri"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;
mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:
Calibri">Support your club and help save lives! To schedule a blood drive,
please contact me! <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;
mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:
Calibri"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;
mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:
Calibri">Sincerely,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none"><o:p style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span class="ui-provider fy b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak" dir="ltr" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">[Insert Name]</span></p>]]></td>
