<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="Default"><span class="A3"><span style="font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">*May
not be combined with the American Red Cross High School Scholarship Program or
Leaders Save Lives Program. **Nontransferable and not redeemable for cash.
Funds will not be paid directly to the community club or school. Fulfillment
information will be provided upon completion of your successful blood drive.
Funds will be made payable to a third-party vendor. The American Red Cross
reserves the right to decline payment to a vendor, in which case a new vendor
must be selected by the community club. Other rules and restrictions may apply.</span></span><span style="font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>]]></td>
